OnikiriStyleDemo: {
	MayoName: 绯村真夜
	L1: 月亮升起来了。绯红的,和我离开那晚一模一样
	L2: (纸垂在夜风里轻轻晃动,某种视线落在你肩上)
	L3: 别紧张,刀还在鞘里
	L4: 这块面板是新裱的:和纸吃了墨,边框是一笔收出来的,顶上那条绸子……嗯,是我系的。你要是盯着这行字看,应该能看到最新的字迹还带着一点没干透的绯色
	ChoicePrompt: 那么——想先看哪一样?
	C1: 看看奖励弹窗(绘马)
	C2: 把刚才的话再演一遍
	C3: 解开鬼切的封印
	C4: 今晚就到这里
	SealedHint: 封印中
	RewardLine: 拿好。普通的刀而已,但挂牌的样子你看到了
	ReplayLine1: 好,再来一遍。注意看说话人换行时,朱印是怎么重新盖下去的
	ReplayLine2: (无名的低语——这一行没有名牌,也没有印)
	Farewell1: 夜还长,茶就不留你了
	Farewell2: 下次再见时,希望是在正式的故事里
}

FirstMetHimayo: {
	SpeakerName: Himura Mayo
	Line1: ...I'm still alive?
	Line2: Wait, let me make sure... Is this some kind of spirit summoning?
	Line3: No.
	Line4: Why is my consciousness inside a sword now?
	Line5: My head hurts... I suppose I'm somewhere between a living person and something inhuman.
	Line6: I have absolutely no idea what happened...
	Line7: Still, from today onward, I hope we'll get along.
}

ToriiSealedDialogue: {
	L1: (You grip the hilt until your knuckles whiten—the blade does not budge, as if cast into the earth itself)
	L2: (From beneath the guard drifts a sigh almost too faint to hear, like a light sleeper turning over)
	L3: (...Not yet. This blade seems to be waiting for the day a great fire burns itself out)
}

ToriiShrine: {
	InteractHint: "[Right Click] Draw the blade"
	SealedHint: "[Right Click] Grip the hilt"
	InventoryFullHint: 背包已满，腾出一格再来拔刀
}

ItCametoThis: {
	Line1: 真不想走到这一步啊
	Line2: 从现在开始，这个世界我接管了
}

//==== Himayo gift scenes (synced from code defaults; neighbor-girl voice) ====

HimayoEyeOfCthulhuGift: {
	L0: Right—back home we used to have a guy who couldn't close his eyes when he slept.
	L1: Not the creepy wide-open kind. Lids half down, staring at the beam like he was spacing out.
	L2: Blankets tucked tight, house dead quiet. One time I walked past his window and almost yelled for help.
	L3: Next day he was fine, hollering from the fields for me to help haul flower pots.
	L4: Ugh, talking about it… looking at those eyes of yours, I'm getting sleepy too. Dropping it.
}

HimayoEvilBossGift: {
	L0Worm: Gross… chunk after chunk jammed in the dirt.
	L1Worm: Reeks like a freshly turned mud ditch. Enough. I don't want to smell that again.
	L0Brain: Brains belong inside a skull.
	L1Brain: Soggy, sprawled out in the open. One look and I'm done.
}

HimayoCalamityEvilGift: {
	L0: Don't just stand there spacing out. Catch your breath, at least.
	L1: That clump earlier… doesn't it look a lot like spoiled red bean paste?
	L2: I regret saying that out loud. Now I'm hungry too.
	L3: If you are too, go find something to eat. Toughing it out after a fight is the dumbest move.
	L4: And don't wipe your hands on your face. Not because you're dirty—it'll sting your eyes. Trust me.
}

HimayoSlimeGodGift: {
	L0: A little sticky, sure. Compared to having sticky in the name, this is nothing.
	L1: Used to bother me. Now… I'm used to it.
	L2: Here. Ask where I pulled it from and I'll pretend I didn't hear.
}

HimayoWallOfFleshGift: {
	L0: Wall's down.
	L1: Not sure if I'm glad or not. Just feels like… weather's about to turn.
	L2: …You know what I mean. That's enough.
}

HimayoAquaticScourgeGift: {
	L0: Hold on. That smell on the edge…
	L1: I live in here. Feels like someone opened a seafood stall.
	L2: Can't even open a window. Swords don't have windows.
	L3: You sure went all in, shoving the whole blade into that stink. Next time, ease up, okay?
}

HimayoBrimstoneElementalGift: {
	L0: Heat's still hanging. Don't touch that puddle—it'll burn.
}

HimayoDestroyerGift: {
	L0: '"The Destroyer"… sounds scary enough.'
	L1: Turns out it's just a really long piece of iron.
	L2: That thing—don't drop it. I'm not picking it up.
}

HimayoTwinsGift: {
	L0: Stare at each other too long and people start laughing.
	L1: You know. The more you hold it in, the more your mouth wants to curl.
	L2: I used to race people on who broke first. I always lost.
	L3: Looking at those two… never mind. I'm smiling again.
}

HimayoSkeletronPrimeGift: {
	L0: Head's still the old one. Body got new iron.
	L1: Like mid-costume-change and they charged out anyway. Off.
}

HimayoCalamitasCloneGift: {
	L0: Copying a walk that well is annoying.
	L1: The closer the copy, the worse it feels. You get it?
	L2: Take it. Don't ask.
}

HimayoPlanteraGift: {
	L0: When a flower's spent, you cut it.
	L1: Leaving the stem doesn't help. Takes space, just irritates people.
	L2: Flower sellers back home all do it that way. Spent means cut—don't dawdle.
	L3: Ah, why am I talking about this. You're not here to buy flowers.
}

HimayoGolemGift: {
	L0: Wrists still numb? Ease your shoulders too.
	L1: Stone's hard. Matching force with force hurts people most.
	L2: Don't bash the blade on it either. If it chips, I live in here—I feel that.
}

HimayoCultistGift: {
	L0: Quiet at the door at last. Ears can rest.
}

HimayoMoonLordGift: {
	L0: That thing up there is gone.
	L1: Not sure I'd call it relief… more like a piece went empty.
	L2: Still on your feet?
}

HimayoProvidenceGift: {
	L0: Air's still hot. Back of the hand feels tight from it.
	L1: Take it. Don't stand here getting roasted.
}

HimayoPolterghastGift: {
	L0: Damp like laundry hung indoors for a week that never dries.
	L1: Sleep here and you'll wake up with a sore back for sure.
	L2: Open a window? What window. No charcoal either.
	L3: Anyway, don't overnight here. Listen to me.
}

HimayoDevourerOfGodsGift: {
	L0: Too big. Empty like someone scooped a chunk out of the sky.
	L1: Don't look too long. Look long enough and you go empty inside too.
}

HimayoYharonGift: {
	L0: Edge is still hot. Warm on my side too—uncomfortable.
	L1: Don't sheath it yet. I'm the one who feels the burn.
	L2: Set this aside for now. We'll talk later.
}

HimayoExoMechsGift: {
	L0: After all that booming, ears still buzz.
	L1: Like someone's tapping a tiny hammer in there. Annoying.
	L2: Want to step away from the noise for a bit? Let your ears rest.
}

HimayoSupremeCalamitasGift: {
	L0: Over there made the air heavy. Sticky-stale kind of heavy.
	L1: Go get some wind, or wash your face. Not because you're dirty—so you clear your head.
	L2: This much… I'm used to it. Just don't stand there blank.
}

HimayoBossRushGift: {
	L0: Stand still first. Don't sway.
}
